   "title": "Interior design",
   "intro": "The First 44 offers a streamlined interior layout that is modern and luminous, with a blend of white lacquered surfaces, moulded woods and tasteful upholsteries.\nWith three cabins and two heads, the interior is designed with quality finishes and materials to create a refined atmosphere.\nIn the saloon, the transverse table seats up to six people and faces the sofa and navigation station; its position in relation to the mast facilitates circulation between the galley and the owner's cabin, enhancing the feeling of space.",
